        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-462 (ensure controlled execution — Project Material Reconciliation &amp; Analytics (PA-77.3).) | - operational: FP&amp;A Manager sign-off on the workflow output
Owner: FP&amp;A Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
