      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly risk review
Frequency: Quarterly
Volume: ~20–30 active projects
Owner: Supply Planning Manager
Participants: Supply Planning Mgr, Procurement, Trade Sales Manager, VP Supply Chain
Source: workflow W2716 — Project Supply Chain Risk &amp; Resilience Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
